Step 2 — Create scripts/evaluate_commitsuite.py. Base it on scripts/evaluate_ollama.py structure. Key differences: (a) Input is CommitSuite/CMG-eval_dataset/all_CMG.json (JSON array, not JSONL). (b) Diff reconstruction: for each entry, join all modified_files as 'diff --git a/{old_path} b/{new_path}
--- a/{old_path}
+++ b/{new_path}
{diff_hunk}
' (the diff field in CommitSuite is a raw hunk without the diff --git header; reconstruct it). Then call build_diff() from commit_model.diff_utils on the joined diff (same filtering as all other scripts). (c) Reference: use entry['description'] as the reference (the commit message body without the type prefix) — CommitSuite intentionally strips the type to avoid giving it away to tools. (d) Keep all metrics from evaluate_ollama.py: valid-format, type-acc, BLEU (sacrebleu), ROUGE-L, METEOR. (e) Add --dataset-path argument defaulting to 'CommitSuite/CMG-eval_dataset/all_CMG.json'. (f) Add --limit argument. (g) Write predictions to preds_commitsuite.jsonl in same format as preds_ollama.jsonl ({"pred": ..., "ref": ...}). (h) Print a note at top: 'Requires Ollama running with the commit-model model (ollama run commit-model)'. (i) Import TYPE_RE, VALID_RE, extract_type from commit_model.diff_utils (FEAT-001 must be complete first).
